## board-check and third-party files
`python3 $POLIER/tools/check.py .` walks every `*.md` under the root, including an installed
`node_modules/`. Third-party READMEs contain relative links that do not resolve in the pnpm
layout, so the `board-check` gate runs against the source tree without `node_modules/`. With
dependencies installed the same command reports those third-party links only; CI must run
`board-check` before `pnpm install` (P0-08). Passing records:
reviews/evidence/P0-04-install-20261025T084450Z.json (PASS, exit 0) and
reviews/evidence/P0-04-board-check-20261025T084530Z.json (PASS, exit 0).

